WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.360
Growth is surging, manufacturing is booming.

00:03.360 --> 00:06.120
The stock market, as I said,

00:06.120 --> 00:08.700
is doing better than it's ever done.

00:08.700 --> 00:11.560
And all of you in this room benefit by that.

00:11.560 --> 00:13.640
Almost everybody.

00:13.640 --> 00:16.080
And importantly, workers' wages are rising

00:16.080 --> 00:20.060
at the fastest pace in more than 60 years.

00:20.060 --> 00:22.440
And that's what it's all about, isn't it?

00:22.440 --> 00:25.940
In four years of President Biden,

00:25.940 --> 00:30.020
we had less than $1 trillion of new investment

00:30.020 --> 00:31.440
into the United States.

